WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:13.620
What is the image of the future that you see?

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.557
We've created a machine that

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:19.200
will solve the world's problems.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.040
We don't teach it.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.860
It teaches itself.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.040
We're going to call it ChatGPT.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.660
We open Pandora's box together.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:33.820
The future is inevitable.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.100
Countries will fall.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:41.060
Industries are going to collapse.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.817
And we get to be the ones to shepherd

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:54.840
people in to this new world.
